 "blank_limit": 6,
 "flags": [
  "Blanks in other attributes can carry signal too. In train, a blank Attr27 adds more than 1.0 calibrated log-odds on average to that attribute's contribution. The app's warning therefore also shows the train and validation history for each blank attribute. 2 of the 3 demo firms have a blank attribute. This is descriptive and is not a test of the effect.",
  "A blank-attribute warning will appear for about half of scorable firms: 47.0% of train and 50.8% of validation firms with Attr21 present have at least one other blank, most often Attr37 (42.3% of train firms). The limit of 6 would block 39 train and 10 validation firms. The effect of these blanks on the score is untested.",
